out={'scope':'Discovery query-domain presentation only; unchanged source corpus, admitted role domains, zero evidence, native ordering, search seed and depth. No rules imported into fresh discovery.','budgets':{'depth':3,'ray_domains_per_label':1,'point_domains_per_label':1,'timeout_seconds_per_arm':300},'selection':'Complete actual initial round000 requested lists plus seven previous depth-control labels, deduplicated:64 single3 and35 double. Original exact source measure identities match initial/current checkpoints.','cases':cases,'points':point_changes,'roundtrip_programs':297,'result':'All297 rays return NoApplicableRule at cap1 and require exact-point fallback. Fixing cuts or cuts+occupations changes no final RHS or ordered condition list. Single3 is64 Applied; double31 Applied/4NoRule for every policy.','limits':'This is a one-domain ray allocation result, not proof that fixed-role symbolic rays cannot help at larger budgets. Rule ordinals can move because unused ray rules precede the same point rule. No coverage, period or full-family closure claim.','performance_scope':'Shared host, two concurrent sectors, historical selection replay included. No timing superiority claim.'}
